{"title":"One negative edge breaks Dijkstra","sub":"The edge B→A costs −4. Textbook Dijkstra locks in A too early; Bellman-Ford never locks anything in.","kind":"graph","interval":1300,"scenarioLabel":"Algorithm","legend":[["b","just finalized"],["a","edge being relaxed"],["bad","ignored, or a wrong final answer"],["good","correct"]],"graph":{"w":540,"h":300,"r":22,"nodes":[{"id":"S","x":60,"y":150},{"id":"A","x":260,"y":60},{"id":"B","x":260,"y":240},{"id":"C","x":470,"y":60}],"edges":[{"u":"S","v":"A","w":2,"dir":true},{"u":"S","v":"B","w":5,"dir":true},{"u":"B","v":"A","w":-4,"dir":true},{"u":"A","v":"C","w":1,"dir":true}]},"scenarios":[{"name":"Textbook Dijkstra","frames":[{"caption":"Textbook Dijkstra: once a vertex is finalized, it is never touched again. One edge here is negative.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0"},"A":{"sub":"∞"},"B":{"sub":"∞"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{}},{"caption":"Finalize <b>S</b> at distance 0.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"b"},"A":{"sub":"∞"},"B":{"sub":"∞"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{}},{"caption":"Relax S→A: A gets distance 2.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"b"},"A":{"sub":"2"},"B":{"sub":"∞"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{"S-A":"a"}},{"caption":"Relax S→B: B gets distance 5.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"b"},"A":{"sub":"2"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{"S-B":"a"}},{"caption":"Finalize <b>A</b> at distance 2.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"good"},"A":{"sub":"2","cls":"b"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{}},{"caption":"Relax A→C: C gets distance 3.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"good"},"A":{"sub":"2","cls":"b"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"3"}},"edges":{"A-C":"a"}},{"caption":"Finalize <b>C</b> at distance 3.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"good"},"A":{"sub":"2","cls":"good"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"3","cls":"b"}},"edges":{}},{"caption":"Finalize <b>B</b> at distance 5.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"good"},"A":{"sub":"2","cls":"good"},"B":{"sub":"5","cls":"b"},"C":{"sub":"3","cls":"good"}},"edges":{}},{"caption":"Edge B→A (-4) would give A distance 1, better than 2, but A is already final. <b>Ignored.</b>","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"good"},"A":{"sub":"2","cls":"good"},"B":{"sub":"5","cls":"b"},"C":{"sub":"3","cls":"good"}},"edges":{"B-A":"bad"}},{"caption":"Final answers: A = 2 and C = 3. The truth is A = 1 (S→B→A) and C = 2. Finalizing A early was a mistake that a negative edge made possible.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"good"},"A":{"sub":"2","cls":"bad"},"B":{"sub":"5","cls":"good"},"C":{"sub":"3","cls":"bad"}},"edges":{}}]},{"name":"Bellman-Ford","frames":[{"caption":"Bellman-Ford: finalize nothing. Just relax <b>every</b> edge, V − 1 = 3 times over.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0"},"A":{"sub":"∞"},"B":{"sub":"∞"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{}},{"caption":"Round 1: relax S→A (2): A becomes 2.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0"},"A":{"sub":"2"},"B":{"sub":"∞"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{"S-A":"a"}},{"caption":"Round 1: relax S→B (5): B becomes 5.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0"},"A":{"sub":"2"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{"S-B":"a"}},{"caption":"Round 1: relax B→A (-4): A becomes 1.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0"},"A":{"sub":"1"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"∞"}},"edges":{"B-A":"a"}},{"caption":"Round 1: relax A→C (1): C becomes 2.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0"},"A":{"sub":"1"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"2"}},"edges":{"A-C":"a"}},{"caption":"Round 2: nothing changes, so every distance has settled.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0"},"A":{"sub":"1"},"B":{"sub":"5"},"C":{"sub":"2"}},"edges":{}},{"caption":"Correct: A = 1, C = 2. One more pass that still improves something would reveal a negative <i>cycle</i>; here there isn't one.","nodes":{"S":{"sub":"0","cls":"good"},"A":{"sub":"1","cls":"good"},"B":{"sub":"5","cls":"good"},"C":{"sub":"2","cls":"good"}},"edges":{}}]}]}